{
  "rules": {
    "robin_bc": {
      "description": "Robin ghost-cell prescription for cell-centered uniform Cartesian grids (ESS §9.2 / §9.4). Robin BC: a·u + b·∂u/∂n = g, where ∂u/∂n is the outward normal derivative; the ghost cell is determined by centered diff across the boundary face: u_ghost = (2·h·g + (2·b - a·h)·u[0]) / (a·h + 2·b). Pattern matches the synthetic `bc` node (§9.2) with `$side` bound to the boundary side (xmin, xmax, ymin, ymax, …) and `$h` bound to the grid spacing for that side's axis via ESS bind_side_spacing guard; `robin_alpha/beta/gamma` carry the Robin coefficients. `produces` declares the ghost variable per §9.4. Pure Dirichlet limit (b=0, a=1, g=u_bc): u_ghost = 2*u_bc - u[0]. Pure Neumann limit (a=0, b=1): u_ghost = u[0] + h*g.",
      "pattern": {
        "op": "bc",
        "fn": "robin",
        "kind": "robin",
        "dim": "$side",
        "side": "$side",
        "args": ["$u"],
        "robin_alpha": "$a",
        "robin_beta": "$b",
        "robin_gamma": "$g"
      },
      "replacement": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$h"] },
                  "$g"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] },
                      { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "$h"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "op": "index", "args": ["$u", 0] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "$h"] },
              { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "ghost_var",
          "name": "robin_bc__$u__$side",
          "emit": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$h"] },
                      "$g"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] },
                          { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "$h"] }
                        ]
                      },
                      { "op": "index", "args": ["$u", 0] }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "$h"] },
                  { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
